OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBlustery band of rain will pass
OL,6,Feastwards over the region to start the
OL,7,Fday, but soon clears. Sunny spells
OL,8,Fthen follow, with just the occasional
OL,9,Flight shower possible, mainly in the
OL,10,Fnorth. Staying breezy and feeling mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny remaining showers will
OL,13,Fsoon fade, leaving a dry night with
OL,14,Fclear spells. Breezy initially but
OL,15,Fwinds soon easing. Becoming chilly
OL,16,Fwith a few misty patches by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
