OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA chilly and bright start
OL,6,Fto Wednesday, but becoming
OL,7,Fincreasingly cloudy through the
OL,8,Fafternoon, though remaining dry. Winds
OL,9,Fstarting light but becoming
OL,10,Fincreasingly breezy through the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FCloudy and mild on Thursday with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain later. Rain clearing
OL,15,Fovernight to bring sunny spells and
OL,16,Fshowers Friday, showers largely
OL,17,Fconfined to the Lincolnshire coast on
OL,18,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
